English Summary (For convenience only; Chinese text above governs)
------------------------------------------------------------------------
CCZJ Video is provided "AS IS", free of charge, solely as a local player and
learning tool for personal study and research. It hosts, bundles, and provides
no media content, has no affiliation with any third-party content providers,
inserts no ads, and collects no telemetry or user data. All third-party media,
ads, and non-sandboxed scripts are solely the user's responsibility. Commercial
use, paid distribution, reselling, repackaging, removal of attribution,
redistribution of modified builds, and public redistribution or traffic-driving
reuploads (even if free) are strictly prohibited without prior written consent.
